Trace field assignment order in this chained constructor snippet. What is output?

```java
class WidgetRecord {
    int capacity;
    String label;
    WidgetRecord() {
        this(10);
        this.label = "Default";
    }
    WidgetRecord(int cap) {
        this.capacity = cap;
        this.label = "Custom";
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        WidgetRecord w = new WidgetRecord();
        System.out.println(w.capacity + " " + w.label);
    }
}
```

