Trace the telescoping constructor chain in this polygon builder. What is printed?

```java
class ShapeSpec {
    int sides;
    int radius;
    String fill;
    ShapeSpec(int sides) {
        this(sides, 10);
    }
    ShapeSpec(int sides, int radius) {
        this(sides, radius, "White");
    }
    ShapeSpec(int sides, int radius, String fill) {
        this.sides = sides;
        this.radius = radius;
        this.fill = fill;
    }
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        ShapeSpec spec = new ShapeSpec(6);
        System.out.println(spec.sides + " " + spec.radius + " " + spec.fill);
    }
}
```
